                "start": 46,
                "end": 52
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "We gathered near the lake, and the weather was comfortable for the entire afternoon.",
            "ko": "우리는 호수 근처에 모였고, 오후 내내 날씨가 쾌적했어요.",
